<li>The Politics of Reform in Thailand: Education in the Reign of King Chulalongkorn (1969)</li>
<li>Thailand: A Short History (1982, 2nd ed. 2003)</li>
<li>Siam in Mind (2002)</li>
<li>Reading Thai Murals (2004)</li>
</ul>
